[h2]Build 0.9.13[/h2]
[h3]Fixed[/h3]
[list]
[*]The Colonists view now shows passions added by other mods (Vanilla Skills Expanded, Alpha Skills and similar). Before, only the two vanilla passions were marked, so a skill with a passion like Competitive looked like it had none.
[/list]
[h3]Changed[/h3]
[list]
[*]The passion under each work box is shown with its own icon where the mod provides one. The tooltip names the passion.
[/list]
[list]
[*]Safe to update mid-save.
[/list]
